
sequenceDiagram
participant UI as Angular UI
participant Tauri as Tauri command
participant Tick as Tick/Engine
participant Core as helix-im
participant Host as host driver
participant DB as SQLite
participant Go as Go IM Server
participant Bus as im:__bus__

UI->>Tauri: im_send_message(payload)
Tauri->>Tick: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
Tick->>Core: ExecutionShell::step
Core->>Core: 校验、生成 temporary_id、构造 body
Core->>Host: Effect::Persist(P1)
Host->>DB: BatchUpsert message
DB-->>Host: PortReply(P1, Ok)
Host->>Core: Tick::PortReply(P1)
Core->>Bus: Emit im:post:sending

opt 已挂载 timeline
Core->>Host: Persist(Scan message)
Host-->>Core: PortReply(timeline)
end

Core->>Host: Effect::Http POST /posts/create
Host->>Go: HTTP request
Go-->>Host: HTTP 2xx admission
Note over Core,Go: 仍然是 Sending，不是 Sent

Go-->>Host: WS post echo
Host->>Core: Tick::Inbound(post)

par 发送对账
Core->>Host: Persist(message temp/id/sent)
Core->>Host: CancelTimer
and MessageV3 G-01
Core->>Host: PersistAtomic(message/channel/member/cursor)
Host-->>Core: PortReply(G-01)
Core->>Host: Persist(ScopedGet channel_member)
Host-->>Core: PortReply(readback)
Core->>Bus: Emit im:post:received(sendStatus=sent)
end

alt HTTP error or timeout
Core->>Host: Persist(message temporary_id/unsend)
Core->>Host: CancelTimer
Core->>Bus: Emit im:post:send-failed
end
